rse the human race.<br><br>A CYNOROID is the only one who enters a research facility infested with deformities.<br>His eyes are just glowing red.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727140/extras/dc076321f2d380250ceb75ef682cd20a.avif?t=1654442020\" width=504 height=80 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727140/extras/ffcab7da6ffeb775cafcb4655517d37d.avif?t=1654442020\" width=438 height=600 /></span><br><br>CYNOROID &quot;gula&quot;<br><br>The latest model of CYNOROID captured by humans.<br>Optimized for long-term exploratory missions.<br>It can temporarily enhance its self-healing ability by ingesting protein from outside.<br>Furthermore, it can generate energy from its normal activities.<br>This energy can be used to stimulate the nervous system of the entire body<br>It is also possible to temporarily enhance physical abilities.<br><br>In addition to being able to handle a variety of weapons, he also carries an energy chainsaw in his arm.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"HELLO ! !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1727140/fb61d07d0126e6588aa1fcb4df723d52a1290387.jpg"},{"name":"R.I.P.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1727140/6847145ab2eed0dab6cfd97e154d052731bc16fb.jpg"},{"name":"EP1_CLEAR!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1727140/07d65cf5be93ea0824b94f4d6994965ec74d1b63.jpg"},{"name":"EP2_CLEAR!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1727140/01f2bf70bb94631aeafaa1846a58d68d059301b5.jpg"},{"name":"EP3_CLEAR!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1727140/b365c8ec1ab62b13828972a392259ef1b8695b42.jpg"},{"name":"CLEAR!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamsta